[Music]  finding a job no matter your industry  can be tough and if you're hiring  getting your job in front of the right  candidate can be both challenging and  expensive part of the challenge is that  there is no standard for writing job  postings as companies we often use  internal language to describe job titles  that may not be obvious to job seekers  this issue is compounded by the fact  that most of the shelf search technology  is keyword based focusing on the two to  three generic words that often make up  job titles while keyword search is  effective at matching keywords to  content it typically fails to return  good results when used for job search  cloud job discovery offers access to  Google's proven search and machine  learning capabilities through a  plug-and-play cloud service improving  job discoverability job seeker  experience and conversion it's packed  with functionality such as seniority  alignment job related synonym and  acronym detection to improve the job  seeker experience and we're constantly  talking to job seekers to find  innovative ways to help them discover  new jobs like preferred commute time and  mode of transit so how does it work  let's take a look at a job site powered  by cloud job discovery this could be a  job board career site applicant tracking  system or any other jobs property the  job content on the site is first  inserted into a private tenant on the  Google cloud platform cloud job  discovery then goes to work  passing classifying and mapping the  content to pre-trained data models which  codify our knowledge and understanding  of occupations skills education and more  here's a visual representation of our  title data model which contains over 250  4000 normalized titles each belonging to  one of 30 top level categories this  knowledge enables us to return not just  the correct role for each job seeker but  also similar roles nearby  when jobseekers search on the site we  apply machine learning to truly  understand the intent of the query and  then retrieve rank and return highly  relevant results that continue to  improve over time hiring companies with  career sites powered by cloud job  discovery such as Johnson &amp; Johnson has  seen remarkable increases in career site  engagement and candidate conversion  especially on hard to fill roles job  boards and applicant tracking systems  using cloud job discovery such as career  builder are also seeing increased  engagement and are benefiting from their  product and engineering teams ability to  focus on tasks higher in the tech stack  matching qualified candidates with the  right job doesn't have to be so hard let  Google power your job site with machine  learning and improve the discoverability  of jobs on your property learn more at  cloud.google.com  you

